            "sid": "ISA 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu dituku adi Bena Ejipitu nebikale bu bakashi. Nebazakale ne nebatshine bua kukuha kua tshianza tshia Yehowa wa misumba tshidiye ukuha ha mutu habo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buloba bua Yuda nebuhatshishe Ejipitu buowa. Muntu yonso wa ku muaba kudibo batela dina dia Yuda neatshine, bualu bua muanda udi Yehowa muhangidishe, udiye mudisunguile bua kuenzela Ejipitu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu dituku adi nemuikale misoko itanu mu buloba bua Ejipitu idi ne bantu bakula muaku wa Bena Kanâna, ne badi baditshiha kudi Yehowa wa misumba. Nebabikile umue wa munkatshi mua misoko yaya ne, Musoko wa Dibutuka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19.18:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Diandamuna dikuabo dia muaku:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Helese",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ", anyi Musoko wa Diba.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu dituku adi tshioshelu tshia Yehowa netshikale mu muaba wa munkatshi mua buloba bua Ejipitu, ne dikunshi nedikale ku mukalu wabu dijidila kudi Yehowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nedikale bu tshimanyinu ne bu tshimanyishilu kudi Yehowa wa misumba mu buloba bua Ejipitu; bualu bua hadilabo kudi Yehowa bua babakengeshi babo, neabatumine musungidi udi kabidi tshilobo, ne yeye neabasungile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa nendimanyishe kudi ba mu Ejipitu, ne Bena Ejipitu nebamanye Yehowa mu ditukuadi. Mmuomu, nebamutendelele ne milambu ya kumuoshela ne milambu ya bia kudia biabo, nebaditshihe mutshihu kudi Yehowa, nebenze bu mudibo baditshiha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa neakume ba mu Ejipitu, neabatahe ne neabasangashe kabidi; nebahingane kudi Yehowa, ne yeye neitabushe bua bamulombe, neakoleshe mibidi yabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
